        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Charlie Rowe, Octavia Spencer, Dave Annable, Philip Pullman, Alastair Paton, Jodelle Ferland, Li Bingbing, Maria Valverde\n- Films/TV: Never Let Me Go, The Boat That Rocked, The Golden Compass, Neverland, Red Band Society, 400 Boys\n- Books/Series: Northern Lights, His Dark Materials\n\nFacts:\n- The Golden Compass is a 2007 British-American fantasy adventure film based on Northern Lights, the first novel in Philip Pullman's His Dark Materials trilogy.\n- Charlie Rowe played Billy Costa in The Golden Compass, James in The Boat That Rocked, Young Tommy in Never Let Me Go, and Peter in the SyFy/Sky Movies Peter Pan prequel Neverland.\n- Charlie Rowe later played Leo Roth on the Fox medical comedy-drama series Red Band Society alongside Octavia Spencer and Dave Annable.\n- 400 Boys is a Canadian-Chinese action-fantasy thriller film directed, written, and produced by Alastair Paton.\n- 400 Boys stars Jodelle Ferland, Li Bingbing, Maria Valverde, and Charlie Rowe.",
